flowchart LR
  Student[Student] --> Login[Login and logout]
  Student --> Registration[Create own student account]
  Student --> EditProfile[Complete own profile]
  Admin[Commission admin] --> Login
  Student --> Profile[Read own profile]
  Student --> Upload[Submit or edit own Ek-16]
  Student --> Report[Read own report and download own document]
  Admin --> Import[Preview and confirm reference dataset import]
  Admin --> References[View independent reference records]
  Admin --> Lists[Read student and application lists]
  Admin --> Review[Review original and manual checks]
  Review --> Approval[Approve and complete after validation]
  Admin --> Recheck[Revalidate report]
  Admin --> Correct[Reasoned update of completed records]
  Admin --> Delete[Confirmed soft delete with version guard]
  Admin --> History[View before and after revision audit]
